  "source": "Cr\u00e9dit Agricole CIB",
  "title": "US CPI: April 2026 preview",
  "type": "economics",
  "priority": "high",
  "published": "2026-05-08",
  "insights": [
   "Cr\u00e9dit Agricole CIB forecasts US CPI to accelerate to 3.77% YoY in April, up from 3.26% in March and 2.41% in February.",
   "The firm expects headline CPI to peak around 4.2% YoY in May before a slow decline to 3.5% by year-end, driven by energy futures backwardation.",
   "Core inflation is projected to remain in the 2.6-2.9% YoY range for the next 12 months, with energy prices keeping core goods inflation firmer than previously anticipated.",
   "Services inflation is expected to remain elevated (3.15-3.40% YoY) through Q1 2027, with OER and rent components impacted by BLS methodological adjustments following the Q4 2025 government shutdown.",
   "The firm's headline forecast (3.77% YoY) is 3bp above the current market consensus of 3.74% YoY."
  ],
  "macro": [
   {
    "indicator": "US Headline CPI (April 2026 Forecast)",
